   \[
   \begin{array}{rlrl}
   2a & \equiv -b \pmod{\pi} & 2c & \equiv -d \pmod{\pi} \\
   2b & \equiv -c \pmod{\pi} & 2d & \equiv -a \pmod{\pi}
   \end{array}
   \]

7. **Solve the simplified system:**
   \[
   \begin{array}{rlrl}
   2a & \equiv -b \pmod{\pi} & 2c & \equiv -d \pmod{\pi} \\
   2b & \equiv -c \pmod{\pi} & 2d & \equiv -a \pmod{\pi}
   \end{array}
   \]
