   \[
   2a \equiv -b \pmod{\pi}, \quad 2b \equiv -c \pmod{\pi}, \quad 2c \equiv -d \pmod{\pi}, \quad 2d \equiv -a \pmod{\pi}
   \]

8. **Count the solutions:**
